<signed><hi rendition="#fr">                                     <hi rendition="#et">J. C. T. <hi rendition="#g">Stever,</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">Prot.</hi></hi>                                 </hi></signed></closer>                     </div>                     <lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/>                     <lb/>
<div type="jAn">                         <p><hi rendition="#fr">Wir Bürgermei&#x017F;tere und Rath der Stadt                                 Ro&#x017F;tock laden,<lb/>
